\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Interior Design Services in Gurgaon\",\"serviceType\":\"Interior Design Services\",\"description\":\"Complete interior design services in Gurgaon by 9th Corner: space planning, 3D views, custom furniture and on-site work for every room.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/gurgaon/services-interior-design-services.php\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Gurgaon\"}}"],"preloads":[],"html":"\n\n    <!-- FAQ Schema -->\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What types of spaces can be covered under interior design services in Gurgaon?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Interior design services can cover residential properties, apartments, villas, offices, commercial spaces, hospitality venues, theatres, and other spaces based on their specific requirements.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How do you create a personalized interior design?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"The design is planned by considering the client's lifestyle, preferences, available space, functionality, furniture requirements, colours, lighting, storage, and overall purpose of the space.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Do you provide 3D visualization before execution?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, 3D visualization allows clients to review the proposed layout, furniture, colours, lighting, and other design elements before execution. Changes can be made during the planning stage when required.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Is project management included in interior design services?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Project management can include planning, material procurement, coordination, execution support, documentation, and monitoring to help keep different stages of the project organized.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Can interior design solutions be customized according to the budget?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, interior solutions can be planned according to the project's requirements, available space, preferred materials, design expectations, and agreed budget while maintaining practical functionality.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What other services are included in interior design?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, it offers a number of other interior design services for residential and commercial schoolroom spaces. You can research our Interior Design Services page to learn more about the services we offer and find the right choice for your project.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script>\n <style>\n/* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/bbb4.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n        .hero-section p {\n            font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 24px);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card.full-width {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 26px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Why Choose Us (Checklist) --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px auto;\n            font-size: 1.05em;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n            padding: 0;\n            list-style: none;\n            max-width: 1100px;\n            margin: 0 auto 40px auto;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list li strong {\n            display: block;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            border-top: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding-top: 30px;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 36px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            padding: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-size: 20px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 12px 36px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }\n\n\n\n                /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n\n    \n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Interior Design Services in Gurgaon</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>Interior Design Services for Functional and Well-Organized Spaces</h2>\n            <p>A well-designed space should be unproblematic, utilitarian, and adapted to the needs and personality of its users. <b>Interior design services in Gurgaon/Gurugram</b> support homeowners, business managers, and companies in designing spaces that unite appearance and usefulness for homes, offices, retail spaces, and other environments.</p>\n            <p>Each project has different requirements. A company may aim for warmth and comfort, while an enterprise space requires a design that helps with organization and productivity. Clear space planning, appropriate materials, and thoughtful layouts ensure spaces work smoothly.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Professional Interior Architecture Solutions for Personalized Spaces</h2>\n            <p>We believe that every interior should be adapted to trends and practical joy. Our design philosophy focuses on creating spaces that reflect the personality, intent, and motivation of the citizens who utilize them.</p>\n            <p>For clients looking for professional solutions for <b>interior architecture in Gurgaon/Gurugram</b>, proper preparation is significant from the start. We review the layout, natural light, furniture, colors, textiles, and overall flow before developing the plan.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (5 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Residential Interior Design</h3>\n                <p>Houses should be well-designed, welcoming, and easy to adjust. We customize apartments, sovereign houses and villas according to the lifestyle of the residents.</p>\n                <p>The living room, bedroom, kitchen, dining room and storage areas are designed so that the whole household feels connected. Our furniture in Gurgaon/Gurugram focuses on practical layouts, suitable furniture, balanced glosses and utility storage.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Commercial & Office Spaces</h3>\n                <p>Commercial spaces necessitate a design that facilitates work while making a positive impression for visitors and customers. We design venues, commercial-grade rooms, amusement rooms and hospitality spaces according to their aim.</p>\n                <p>Workspaces, customer premises, subterfuges, furniture, lighting, and motion are carefully designed to support jobs, creating organized spaces that help ensure productivity and customer loyalty.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Luxury & Custom Interiors</h3>\n                <p>We make sophisticated and personalized interiors for clients who need a typical look. Furniture, carpets, fixtures, lighting, colors, and surfaces are chosen according to the overall concept.</p>\n                <p>The emphasis is on creating a balanced space where everyone works. These token-by-token solutions provide operative <b>Interior Design Services in gurgaon</b> for theatres, venues, and other spaces according to individual requirements.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Spatial Planning & 3D Visualization</h3>\n                <p>Full space decoration helps to make the most of each space. Furniture, aims, carriageways, work surfaces and other components are arranged according to the size and destination of the space.</p>\n                <p>3D visualization allows clients to visualize the design before execution. You can control layouts, furniture, colors, lighting, and other elements and offer modifications if necessary to reduce mix-ups and ensure a fluid execution process.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>Turnkey Project Management</h3>\n                <p>Internal work includes various forms, including fabric exception, acquisition, performance, coordination, and tone control. The proper management of these steps is used to organize the workplace.</p>\n                <p>We support you from planning to execution through project management, planned to adjust the studies to the demands, design, chronology, and budgets agreed upon.</p>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Why Choose Our Interior Design Services in Gurgaon?</h2>\n            <div class=\"why-choose-intro\">\n                <p>The presence of the appropriate design team can facilitate the macrocosm and monitoring of an intragroup project. Our team strives to provide creative themes and hard-nosed solutions for your place.</p>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Expert Designers</strong>\n                    The purposes are developed according to the design, architectural scale, and functional needs of each undertaking.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Customized Resolutions</strong>\n                    The layouts, furniture, colors, and fabrics are chosen according to personal preferences and brand character.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Smart Space & Budget Planning</strong>\n                    Pocket intention parts are considered from a balanced planetary perspective without compromising quality.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Final Support & Project Management</strong>\n                    Funding and oversight are provided for design, preparation, procurement, execution, and project management.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects in Gurgaon</h2>\n                <p>Showcasing our completed residential and commercial spaces designed with excellence.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">